      "model": "gpt-image-2.6-sunburst",
      "prompt": "Attached are two authentic Bilibili character stickers of Xingtong in the SAME outfit: 揣手手 and 老实. The strip of flat paint chips below is sampled from those originals. Treat their shapes and exact original colors as the design model. Clean finished hand-drawn Japanese/Chinese chibi sticker, subtly detailed: thin yet decisive deep charcoal-indigo contour, softly modeled two/three-tone cel shading, crisp selected highlights, a trace of paper tooth. Color as a daylight-painted sticker on white, never a violet or pink color wash, no glow, no type, no diagram or tiles. The silver bob has NEUTRAL cool silver grey local color RGB 197,194,201, broad near-white ribbon-shaped painted reflections, cool grey shadows 160,157,170, very little chroma. Bright clear medium sky-blue irises (74,141,233) and white glints. Distinct softly rounded CORAL dash blush from the original at both cheeks. Skin warm ivory-peach, thin pink mouth. Soft cardigan is pale icy PERIWINKLE RGB 219,220,253, bluer than mauve and distinct from grey hair; pearly ivory fur collar, rose-pink inner top. Headband deep violet, little white round mascot with blue dot and tiny coral cheeks. Preserve the distinctive rounded side hair, large grouped locks and asymmetric crown forelock exactly. Create a cut-out asset: ONE completely isolated HEAD only, front-facing, exactly upright. Full silver bob, curved forelock, purple headband, little white mascot near viewer-right, chubby cheeks and chin. No neck, clothes, fists, shoulders, arms or props anywhere. Include the complete silhouette with at least 7% surrounding clearance. View straight at a lightly pouting chibi Xingtong, cheeks puffed like a mild hmph, half-lidded blue eyes looking at the viewer, tiny pursed mouth gently skewed. Eyes read as crisp BLUES, neutral silver hair sections match the attached, subtle rosy short dash each cheek. Add restrained hair/iris detail but retain the original's recognizable face. Transparent background, perfectly isolated clean head animation cel with smooth alpha edges. One head only.",
