    "body": {
      "model": "gpt-image-2.6-sunburst",
      "prompt": "Attached are two authentic Bilibili character stickers of Xingtong in the SAME outfit: 揣手手 and 老实. The strip of flat paint chips below is sampled from those originals. Treat their shapes and exact original colors as the design model. Clean finished hand-drawn Japanese/Chinese chibi sticker, subtly detailed: thin yet decisive deep charcoal-indigo contour, softly modeled two/three-tone cel shading, crisp selected highlights, a trace of paper tooth. Color as a daylight-painted sticker on white, never a violet or pink color wash, no glow, no type, no diagram or tiles. The silver bob has NEUTRAL cool silver grey local color RGB 197,194,201, broad near-white ribbon-shaped painted reflections, cool grey shadows 160,157,170, very little chroma. Bright clear medium sky-blue irises (74,141,233) and white glints. Distinct softly rounded CORAL dash blush from the original at both cheeks. Skin warm ivory-peach, thin pink mouth. Soft cardigan is pale icy PERIWINKLE RGB 219,220,253, bluer than mauve and distinct from grey hair; pearly ivory fur collar, rose-pink inner top. Headband deep violet, little white round mascot with blue dot and tiny coral cheeks. Preserve the distinctive rounded side hair, large grouped locks and asymmetric crown forelock exactly. Create one isolated front-view 2D animation BODY plate from the neckline down, from Xingtong's same outfit, to sit under a separate large chibi head later. Center the OPEN NECK and symmetrical shoulders of this compact chest-up chibi torso; the top of the picture is empty clear alpha. The head, hair and any facial features are entirely omitted. Small neck and upper chest are visible above an ivory fluffy jacket collar with a pink shirt between the sides. Puffy blue-periwinkle sleeves, ribbed sleeve cuffs. Both forearms extend gently toward the viewer and rest HORIZONTALLY on the same invisible surface. Put BOTH little hands with fingers relaxed and resting flat PALM DOWN on exactly the same y-level at the bottom foreground, separated by a small gap, pointing gently inwards. The two little hands do not form fists or touch any cheek. To be legible at chat size, let the hands peek out past each padded cuff; natural clean fingers and thumb, no duplicate fingertips. Keep the body, sleeves and hands completely in frame with modest margins, occupying lower two thirds and using 85% of canvas width. Keep the neckline narrow at center, let collar wrap in a shallow V. NO table line, no surface texture, no human head, no wig, no floating extra accessory. Genuine transparent background and clean isolated outline appropriate for an animation body layer. Model the soft periwinkle folds with a few delicate blue-cool shadows, avoid pink or saturated purple shadows. The pose should feel like waiting at a desk with a pout, her weight quietly on both forearms.",
